* text=auto eol=lf
*.zsh text eol=lf

# The build stamp reported by /api/version. `git archive` substitutes %h here, so
# a source tarball names the commit it was cut from -- without this the tarball
# carried whatever hash happened to be committed to the file, which was weeks
# stale and reported as the running build on every from-source install (BSD,
# OpenBSD, macOS) and in the OPNsense plugin.
meow_ac/_commit.txt export-subst
